WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.834
Give an AI agent a payment wallet, and a fake invoice, a phishing domain, or a stale sanctions list can drain funds in seconds.

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:11.103
Pramaan Desk verifies payments before keys ever sign.

00:00:11.103 --> 00:00:31.644
On our homepage benchmark across five adversarial failure modes — inverted currency rates, lapsed company registrations, phishing URLs, arithmetic drift, and sanctions collisions — an ungrounded agent lost seventy-nine thousand three hundred seventy-three dollars, while Pramaan caught all five with a one-hundred-percent block rate.

00:00:31.644 --> 00:00:33.802
Let's open the live Operator Desks.

00:00:34.702 --> 00:00:46.468
In Trade Assurance, Purchase Order ninety-twenty-one models a one-hundred-thousand-USDC commitment anchored to our PramanEscrow contract on Ethereum Sepolia against a Cainiao warehouse receipt from the Port of Los Angeles.

00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:50.004
Eighty units passed inspection and twenty arrived damaged.

00:00:50.004 --> 00:01:04.879
In Case A, submitting a full hundred-thousand-dollar claim trips our six-hundred-fifty-one-byte WebAssembly comparator at Stage Thirteen, catching the twenty-thousand-dollar overbilling shortfall in under three milliseconds and halting release.

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:24.570
Switching to Case B reconciles line by line: releasing eighty thousand USDC to Siemens Aktiengesellschaft under its verified German LEI, refunding twenty thousand USDC to the buyer, updating the Disposition Board, and generating an EIP-one-ninety-one memo that anyone can verify directly in slash verify inside the browser.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:30.836
The same firewall guards Solana wallets before a transaction ever reaches an RPC node.

00:01:30.836 --> 00:01:44.125
Our Solana middleware inspects legacy and versioned transactions locally, blocks compromised web3 hooks, known drainers, and Token-Twenty-Twenty traps like PermanentDelegate TLV Twelve in roughly two milliseconds.

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:56.478
Compliant transfers approve cleanly alongside live Solana Devnet confirmations, backed by thirty unit tests and seven live Devnet checks, plus a server-side policy gate for custom vendor spend caps.

00:01:57.378 --> 00:02:00.219
Every verification carries an auditable receipt.

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:14.604
Our Settlement Ledger logs thirty-two live Ethereum Sepolia settlements across fifteen independent Telegraph miners, sovereign PramanEscrow deals, and Devnode escrow signals — click any row to inspect its signal hash and Etherscan proof.

00:02:14.604 --> 00:02:31.180
In our Mining Registry, Pramaan resolves conflicting geological claims against Queensland Government records — reconciling Mount Morgan's forty-four-ton survey variance cleanly, while returning Unverified Prospect at twenty percent confidence on unknown sites instead of guessing.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.966
In Desk Five, you can run live checks against arbitrary inputs.

00:02:35.966 --> 00:02:41.085
A thousand units times twelve dollars forty cents reconciles with zero discrepancy.

00:02:41.085 --> 00:02:56.936
Sanctions screening checks nineteen thousand six hundred twenty-nine US Treasury OFAC records in RAM — updated daily so today's additions are never stale — and flags phonetic near-misses like Viktor But for manual review at seventy-eight percent similarity.

00:02:56.936 --> 00:03:15.809
Below it, our Agent Claim Verifier catches currency and IBAN hallucinations from third-party agent outputs, our Track Three batch evaluator audits up to fifty names alongside our LoRA adapter registration two-eighty-five, and the raw six-hundred-fifty-one-byte comparator runs directly inside your browser.

00:03:16.709 --> 00:03:18.797
Integrating takes one endpoint.

00:03:18.797 --> 00:03:31.056
In Docs, Pramaan exposes nineteen keyless tools over Streamable MCP, TypeScript and Python SDKs, an Animoca Minds skill, Praman Spend Guard, and ByteDance Creative Quality Assurance.

00:03:31.056 --> 00:03:41.563
On our Roadmap, we separate what runs live today on testnets and live government registries from the custody and ERP adapters needed for production mainnet.

00:03:41.563 --> 00:03:51.060
Registered on Telegraph Protocol as Miner six-one-six-four and Diamond six-two-zero-one, Pramaan Desk verifies every dollar before keys sign.
